Provides training in coordinated mouth-to-mouth artificial ventilation and chest compression, choking, life-threatening emergencies and sudden illness. Lecture 1 hour per week. HLT 106 First Aid and Safety (2 credits)

Focuses on the principles and techniques of safety and first aid. Lecture 2 hours per week.
